.TH AVR\-SKILL\-UNINSTALL 1 "" "avr 0.2.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-skill-uninstall \- Uninstall the Avrea skill.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr skill uninstall
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Uninstall the Avrea skill.
.PP
Uninstall the Avrea skill. Alias: remove.
.PP
Unmanaged skill directories are never removed automatically.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr skill uninstall
    avr skill uninstall --target claude
    avr skill remove --target codex
    avr skill uninstall --target all --force
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-target\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Installed agent host to uninstall from. (choices: codex, claude, all; default: all)
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Remove a locally modified avr-managed skill.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-skill (1),
.BR avr-skill-install (1),
.BR avr-skill-status (1),
.BR avr-skill-update (1)
